@host = http://localhost:5297
@packageHash = replace-from-package-list
@sessionId = replace-after-create
@supplierTeamId = replace-after-add
@carrierTeamId = replace-after-add
@supplierEntityId = replace-after-create
@carrierEntityId = replace-after-create
@supplierPairingCode = replace-after-add
@carrierPairingCode = replace-after-add
@supplierToken = replace-after-pair
@carrierToken = replace-after-pair
@adminToken = deployment-provisioned-admin-token-for-session
@supplierAssignmentId = replace-from-supplier-experience
@carrierAssignmentId = replace-from-carrier-experience

### 1. List installed Story Packages and copy sample contentHash
GET {{host}}/api/story-packages

### 2. Inspect safe package metadata
GET {{host}}/api/story-packages/sample-cargo-delay/1.0.0

### 3. Create Session — state version 1
POST {{host}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"storyPackageId":"sample-cargo-delay","storyVersion":"1.0.0","contentHash":"{{packageHash}}","seed":42,"expectedVersion":0}

### 4. Add Supplier Team — version 2
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"تیم تامین‌کننده","expectedVersion":1}

### 5. Add Carrier Team — version 3
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/teams
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"تیم حمل‌کننده","expectedVersion":2}

### 6. Create Supplier Entity — version 4
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{"definitionId":"supplier","displayName":"تامین‌کننده","controllerType":"HumanTeam","behaviorProfileId":null,"expectedVersion":3}

### 7. Create Carrier Entity — version 5
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/entities
Content-Type: application/json

{"definitionId":"carrier","displayName":"حمل‌کننده","controllerType":"HumanTeam","behaviorProfileId":null,"expectedVersion":4}

### 8. Assign Supplier — version 6
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{"entityId":"{{supplierEntityId}}","teamId":"{{supplierTeamId}}","expectedVersion":5}

### 9. Assign Carrier — version 7
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/assignments
Content-Type: application/json

{"entityId":"{{carrierEntityId}}","teamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","expectedVersion":6}

### 10. Start Session — version 8
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/start
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedVersion":7}

### 11. Initialize narrative as Admin; copy returned stateVersion
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/narrative/initialize
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedStateVersion":8,"commandId":"81000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### 12. Pair Supplier
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId":"{{supplierTeamId}}","pairingCode":"{{supplierPairingCode}}"}

### 13. Pair Carrier
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/pair
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamId":"{{carrierTeamId}}","pairingCode":"{{carrierPairingCode}}"}

### 14. Supplier private experience (must not contain Carrier Storylet)
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}

### 15. Carrier private experience (must not contain Supplier Storylet)
GET {{host}}/api/story/experience
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}

### 16. Supplier choice — replace expectedStateVersion
POST {{host}}/api/story/choices
Authorization: Bearer {{supplierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":"{{supplierAssignmentId}}","choiceId":"disclose-full-delay","expectedStateVersion":20,"commandId":"82000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### 17. Carrier choice — replace expectedStateVersion
POST {{host}}/api/story/choices
Authorization: Bearer {{carrierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":"{{carrierAssignmentId}}","choiceId":"reserve-emergency-capacity","expectedStateVersion":21,"commandId":"82000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002"}

### 18. Resolve as Admin — replace expectedStateVersion
POST {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/narrative/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"expectedStateVersion":22,"commandId":"83000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001"}

### 19. Read public outcome and metrics
GET {{host}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/public

### 20. Verify health
GET {{host}}/health

###
GET {{host}}/alive

###
GET {{host}}/ready
